{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":127050,"Title":"liked a post you made in Beach Palace Cancun Brides","Message":"Hello!\n\nFutureMrsGarcia just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  @  Thank you for your input! I see both of your weddings are coming up really soon! Congratulations <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/63613-beach-palace-cancun-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1907373\n","Sender":{"Id":281504,"Name":"FutureMrsGarcia","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281504.jpeg?_r=1431459531","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1447252715,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":126960,"Title":"liked a post you made in Beach Palace Cancun Brides","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@  @  Thank you for your input! I see both of your weddings are coming up really soon! Congratulations <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/63613-beach-palace-cancun-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1907373\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1447221717,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":126907,"Title":"liked a post you made in Beach Palace Cancun Brides","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nHi BP brides!\n \nI'm starting to plan my wedding for December 2016, and I was wondering...for those who have had\/will be having December weddings, what time are you planning your ceremonies? I've read that 1.5 hours before sunset is ideal for photos. I know that Cancun recently...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/63613-beach-palace-cancun-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1907351\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1447194246,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":122320,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that perianjay mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/63613-beach-palace-cancun-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1906194\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"greeneggsnsam\" Good idea! It's a lot easier to have a travel agent to help coordinate and also to follow up with your guests. Believe me it becomes very stressful at some points so you don't want to be worrying about your guests booking and chasing them etc. My travel agent was a huge help with that and she also helped by sometimes liaising with the resort when I needed her to. If you ever have questions just let me know.\nDecember is a really popular month it seems. There's another wedding the same week we are down there at our resort as well. I think a few days before ours. \n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1444720108,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":122316,"Title":"liked a post you made in Beach Palace Cancun Brides","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThanks for the feedback, @ ! We definitely want to book as a group (as the perks seem AMAZING!). From your experience, it sounds like having a travel agent to help with coordination is really beneficial. I've reached out to one to see what kinds of services they offer. \n <p...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/63613-beach-palace-cancun-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1906167\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1444719984,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":122027,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that perianjay mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/63613-beach-palace-cancun-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1906108\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"greeneggsnsam\" Hi! Welcome to the forum. I'm getting married around the same time except this year.\n \nI'm not too sure how comparable the rates would be as i'm flying out of Toronto, Canada, but I do know that December is considered high season for travel so it's a bit more of a costly month to book.\n \nPalace resorts have a lot of perks if you book as a group. I'm not sure how that would work if you're all planning to book on your own, but there may be some risk in doing that with availability and having to ensure that your guests book before the resort is booked etc etc.\nI'm actually very glad we went with a travel agent as she was able to really organize the entire group and make sure everyone paid their final payment in time. We are now two months away and the resort is almost fully booked. My travel agent actually made an inquiry to add an additional room to my room block and they said the resort is booked up.\nIf you get an agent and they designate a room block those are guaranteed rooms for your guests and it will also count toward all of the group benefits that palace offers.\n \nIf you have any other questions, feel free to DM me! I'm two months away now <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1444385636,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":117344,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"greeneggsnsam,\n\nTammyWright has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"Welcome greeneggsnsam to Best Destination Wedding\".\n\nTammyWright said:\n======================================================================\nHello greeneggsnsam,<br \/><br \/>Welcome to BestDestinationWedding.com (BDW). BDW is the Ultimate Resource for planning your destination wedding. We have over 70,000 registered bride, grooms and vendors.<br \/><br \/>Here are some links and tips that might make your time here on BDW more enjoyable.<br \/><br \/>If you have not done so, you may want to:<br \/>complete your profile (upload a photo, add profile details, etc.)<br \/>visit the Newbies forum and introduce yourself (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/f\/23\/newbies)<br \/>Start your own wedding planning blog (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/blogs\/)<br \/>find the forum for your wedding destination and create a subscription to threads\/members\/vendors that you are interested in<br \/><br \/>Here are some links that may be helpful to you:<br \/>Destination Wedding Community & Forum (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/f\/)<br \/>Resort Reviews (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/products\/category\/resorts-villas)<br \/>Wedding Vendor Reviews (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/products\/category\/wedding-vendors)<br \/>Destination Wedding Tips and Articles (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips)<br \/>Wedding Image Gallery (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/recent\/albums)<br \/>BDW Help Page (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=help)<br \/>BDW Forum Rules and Etiquette (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/8853\/forum-faqs-etiquette-rules)<br \/>How to Download Attachments (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/48545\/update-1-18-2010-downloading-attachments)<br \/><br \/>Here are some BDW members and staff you should follow:<br \/><br \/>Moderators and Community Leaders<br \/>Tammy Host - Founder and Owner of BDW (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/206696-tammy-host\/). Tammy got married at Dreams Los Cabos in 2006<br \/>AlexisinJamaica (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/255437-alexisinjamaica\/) - Moderator & Community Leader. Alexis got married in Jamaica in 2013.<br \/><br \/>If you would like to \"like\" or \"follow\" us, here are our BDW accounts:<br \/>BDW on Facebook (http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/BDWForum)<br \/>BDW on Twitter (http:\/\/twitter.com\/BDWForum)<br \/>BDW on Pinterest (http:\/\/pinterest.com\/bdwforum\/)<br \/><br \/>If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business, please email advertise@bestdestinationwedding.com (mailto:advertise@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20Inquiry%20for%20BDW).<br \/><br \/>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read! (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010)<br \/><br \/>Please feel free to browse around and get to know others. If you have any questions please don't hesitate to ask. Hope you enjoy your time here.<br \/><br \/>Team BDW\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=11468#msg20474\n","Sender":{"Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1442352408,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":11468}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"7","TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
