{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":323,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":11984,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1900929,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1444491864","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1437558963,"LastPoster":{"Id":284292,"Name":"STBMrsPowell","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284292.jpg?_r=1442327838","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":2,"Preview":{"Id":1907929,"PostDate":1448703623,"PostContent":"@Wafflesmom, I'm well, but as you can imagine...frustrated.\u00a0 I've had my wedding specialist get i...","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">STBMrsPowell <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/span>","Email":"shay_tt03@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"152.132.9.140","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1438753999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284292.jpg?_r=1442327838","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"STBMrsPowell","Id":284292,"Name":"STBMrsPowell","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79425,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"60972e522ba065a1e3f2c545b25edbf3","RawContent":"@[member=\"STBMrsPowell\"] how are you? It&#039;s definitely been a while since I&#039;ve seen you on the forum. Hope you&#039;re doing well\n\n\nYes, we&#039;re counting down and getting so excited. We&#039;re at the point that our favourite saying is now \"it is what it is\" lol We&#039;re focusing on what&#039;s important and not letting anything get to us\n\n\nI&#039;m so sorry you&#039;re getting a different experience with Yanet. I&#039;m sure it has to do with all the hiccups with Jamaica being a new location. Hope it gets better. We went with three Palace approved vendors, LatinAsia for flowers and d\u00e9cor, PSAV for DJ and Styling Trio for hair and makeup. For photography, I fell in love with Samuel Luna&#039;s style and he&#039;s an outside vendor. We&#039;re paying the vendor fee for him and his assistant. For the most part, the vendors have all been pretty responsive. Though I have been waiting a few days for LatinAsia toget back to me with an updated PO. Once we get that, we can pay off everything! That will be such a nice feeling\n\n\nI&#039;m assuming their vendors are different in Jamaica. I have been seeing a lot of pics of your resort and I&#039;m so impressed! They&#039;ve really outdone themselves and so far, brides have been very pleased. Let me know if I can help you in any way:)","Attachments":[],"Id":1907819,"PostDate":1448304830,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284292\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/284292-stbmrspowell\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">STBMrsPowell<\/span><\/a> how are you? It's definitely been a while since I've seen you on the forum. Hope you're doing well<br><br>\nYes, we're counting down and getting so excited. We're at the point that our favourite saying is now \"it is what it is\" lol We're focusing on what's important and not letting anything get to us<br><br>\nI'm so sorry you're getting a different experience with Yanet. I'm sure it has to do with all the hiccups with Jamaica being a new location. Hope it gets better. We went with three Palace approved vendors, LatinAsia for flowers and d\u00e9cor, PSAV for DJ and Styling Trio for hair and makeup. For photography, I fell in love with Samuel Luna's style and he's an outside vendor. We're paying the vendor fee for him and his assistant. For the most part, the vendors have all been pretty responsive. Though I have been waiting a few days for LatinAsia toget back to me with an updated PO. Once we get that, we can pay off everything! That will be such a nice feeling<br><br>\nI'm assuming their vendors are different in Jamaica. I have been seeing a lot of pics of your resort and I'm so impressed! They've really outdone themselves and so far, brides have been very pleased. Let me know if I can help you in any way:)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"My planning thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/<\/a><br><br>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160123\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/44c5\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1410069785,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1444491864","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"45.19.196.91","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79425,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ec55be4b99d31c994365f3e32dc3ba5f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi @[member=\"STBMrsPowell\"] ! Yanet is my wedding coordinator too! I&#039;m getting married at Beach Palace in February. I just wanted to let you know that a few months ago I was super frustrated with Yanet (@[member=\"Wafflesmom\"] may remember). &amp;nbsp;It would sometimes take her weeks to get back to me and then I didn&#039;t feel like she was answering my exact questions. I was really worried. &amp;nbsp;Lately she has been very responsive to me - she gets back to me the same day or the next day. She has been super helpful! &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m wondering if she is more helpful\/responsive now because my wedding is getting closer? &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m hoping that this will give you hope that things will get better as your wedding date gets closer!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907821,"PostDate":1448306678,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284292\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/284292-stbmrspowell\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">STBMrsPowell<\/span><\/a> ! Yanet is my wedding coordinator too! I'm getting married at Beach Palace in February. I just wanted to let you know that a few months ago I was super frustrated with Yanet (@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279721\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279721-wafflesmom\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Wafflesmom<\/span><\/a> may remember). \u00a0It would sometimes take her weeks to get back to me and then I didn't feel like she was answering my exact questions. I was really worried. \u00a0Lately she has been very responsive to me - she gets back to me the same day or the next day. She has been super helpful! \u00a0I'm wondering if she is more helpful\/responsive now because my wedding is getting closer? \u00a0I'm hoping that this will give you hope that things will get better as your wedding date gets closer!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erikahime@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.191.153.24","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421789107,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281815.jpg?_r=1431031761","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":278,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Danielle1","Id":281815,"Name":"Danielle1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"152.132.9.140","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79425,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"467d96aba5eca72de459337e47f869d5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Wafflesmom\"], I&#039;m well, but as you can imagine...frustrated.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;ve had my wedding specialist get in touch with Yanet&#039;s supervisor, and of course...it seems to be that the particular vendor they&#039;re using for d\u00e9cor is the problem.&amp;nbsp; They have been VERY slow in responding.&amp;nbsp; I know a lot rests on the shoulders of Yanet, but I&#039;m a bit upset with her because her responses are EXTREMELY slow and have little to no information.&amp;nbsp; I constantly get responses like \"Thanks for your patience, waiting to hear back from the vendor\" and so on and so forth.&amp;nbsp; It has left a sour taste in my mouth so to speak.&amp;nbsp; But I&#039;m sure (and constantly praying) that it will get better.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Danielle1\"], hi!&amp;nbsp; Congrats on your nuptials.&amp;nbsp; I see you can understand what I mean with Yanet.&amp;nbsp; She is giving me the same problems.&amp;nbsp; However, I do believe it is what you say.&amp;nbsp; The closer you are to your wedding date, the more helpful I&#039;m sure she becomes.&amp;nbsp; Apparently, she&#039;s quite busy as there are a few brides I&#039;ve seen post her as their WC.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m looking forward to both of your feedback once you get onsite and see how everything goes then.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m sure everything will work out;&amp;nbsp;in the meantime, my wedding specialist and I have had to escalate the problems I&#039;m experiencing and get some of the Palace Resort brass to get involved as well.&amp;nbsp; I mean, June seems far away but when it comes to a wedding, it&#039;s never too far away :).&amp;nbsp; Good luck ladies!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907929,"PostDate":1448703623,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279721\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279721-wafflesmom\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Wafflesmom<\/span><\/a>, I'm well, but as you can imagine...frustrated.\u00a0 I've had my wedding specialist get in touch with Yanet's supervisor, and of course...it seems to be that the particular vendor they're using for d\u00e9cor is the problem.\u00a0 They have been VERY slow in responding.\u00a0 I know a lot rests on the shoulders of Yanet, but I'm a bit upset with her because her responses are EXTREMELY slow and have little to no information.\u00a0 I constantly get responses like \"Thanks for your patience, waiting to hear back from the vendor\" and so on and so forth.\u00a0 It has left a sour taste in my mouth so to speak.\u00a0 But I'm sure (and constantly praying) that it will get better.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281815\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281815-danielle1\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Danielle1<\/span><\/a>, hi!\u00a0 Congrats on your nuptials.\u00a0 I see you can understand what I mean with Yanet.\u00a0 She is giving me the same problems.\u00a0 However, I do believe it is what you say.\u00a0 The closer you are to your wedding date, the more helpful I'm sure she becomes.\u00a0 Apparently, she's quite busy as there are a few brides I've seen post her as their WC.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm looking forward to both of your feedback once you get onsite and see how everything goes then.\u00a0 I'm sure everything will work out;\u00a0in the meantime, my wedding specialist and I have had to escalate the problems I'm experiencing and get some of the Palace Resort brass to get involved as well.\u00a0 I mean, June seems far away but when it comes to a wedding, it's never too far away <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>.\u00a0 Good luck ladies!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">STBMrsPowell <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/span>","Email":"shay_tt03@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"152.132.9.140","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1438753999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284292.jpg?_r=1442327838","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"STBMrsPowell","Id":284292,"Name":"STBMrsPowell","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79425","Title":"Wafflesmom Moon Palace Planning Thread - January 23, 2016","LastPostDate":1448703623},"Pages":{"TotalItems":323,"TotalPages":33,"CurrentPage":320,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":310,"LastPage":320},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
